<title>USA: Telecom Argentina sets payout.</title>
<headline>Telecom Argentina sets payout.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Argentina STET-France Telecom SA said on Tuesday it set a cash dividend of 0.215 Argentine pesos per share or 2.15 Argentine pesos per American Depository Receipts (ADRs) to be paid in two installments.</p>
<p>The company said that the first installment of 0.129 pesos per share or 1.29 pesos per ADR would be paid on December 27, with a record date of December 23 for ADR holders and December 26 for non-ADR holders.</p>
<p>The second installation of 0.086 pesos or 0.86 pesos per ADR would be paid on March 26, and a record date would be announced once available, the company said.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
